                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="box">

                <h3>Programming</h3>

                <p>
                    Skilled in Python, C/C++, Java, SQL, and problem-solving.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="box">

                <h3>Creative Design</h3>

                <p>
                    Designing modern user interfaces with animations and smooth effects.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->

    <section class="about">

        <h2>About Me</h2>

        <p>
            Hello! My name is Sahil Thote. I am currently pursuing Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech)
            in Artificial Intelligence and Data Science from Yeshwantrao Chavan College of Engineering (YCCE), Nagpur.
            Currently, I am in my 2nd year of engineering. I am passionate about web development,
            programming, and continuously learning new technologies to improve my skills.
        </p>

    </section>

    <!-- Contact Section -->

    <section class="contact">

        <h2>Contact Me</h2>

        <p>📧 sahilthote382@gmail.com</p>

        <p>📱 +91 9699919385</p>

        <p>📍 Nagpur, India</p>

    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->

    <footer>

        <p>
            © 2026 Sahil Thote | Creative Landing Page
        </p>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
